ctions":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@preconcurrency","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"unfolding"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"produce"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"text":" () ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:Scs7Elementxmfp"},{"text":"?) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Failure"},{"text":" == any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Error","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Error","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A closure that asynchronously produces elements for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"produce"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this convenience initializer when you have an asynchronous function","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that can produce elements for the stream, and don’t want to invoke"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a continuation manually. This initializer “unfolds” your closure into"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a full-blown asynchronous stream. The created stream handles adherence to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"code":"AsyncSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol automatically. To terminate the stream with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an error, throw the error from your closure."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example shows an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncThrowingStream"},{"type":"text","text":" created with this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"initializer that produces random numbers on a one-second interval. If the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"random number is divisible by 5 with no remainder, the stream throws a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MyRandomNumberError"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let stream = AsyncThrowingStream<Int, Error> {","    await Task.sleep(1 * 1_000_000_000)","    let random = Int.random(in: 1...10)","    if random % 5 == 0 {","        throw MyRandomNumberError()","    }","    return random","}","","\/\/ Call point:","do {","    for try await random in stream {","        print(random)","    }","} catch {","    print(error)","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"Swift","images":[{"type":"card","identifier":"Swift-PageImage-card.png"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Build apps using a powerful open language.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swift","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift"},"Swift-PageImage-card.png":{"type":"image","alt":"An orange Swift logo on a gradient background.","identifier":"Swift-PageImage-card.png","variants":[{"traits":["2x","light"],"url":"\/images\/com.apple.Swift\/Swift-PageImage-card@2x.png"},{"url":"\/images\/com.apple.Swift\/Swift-PageImage-card~dark@2x.png","traits":["2x","dark"]}]},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/Error":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Error","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A type representing an error value that can be thrown.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swift\/error","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Error"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Error","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Error","type":"topic"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/AsyncThrowingStream":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"AsyncThrowingStream","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"AsyncThrowingStream","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An asynchronous sequence generated from an error-throwing closure that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calls a continuation to produce new elements."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/asyncthrowingstream","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncThrowingStream","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncThrowingStream","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/AsyncThrowingStream/init(unfolding:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncThrowingStream\/init(unfolding:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Constructs an asynchronous throwing stream from a given element-producing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"closure.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"unfolding"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":" () "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:Scs7Elementxmfp"},{"kind":"text","text":"?)"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/asyncthrowingstream\/init(unfolding:)","role":"symbol","title":"init(unfolding:)","type":"topic"}}}